I think it's very similar. Pets are not like anything else in the game, 
but they still fit in. Some people like them, some don't. If you don't 
use them, you make the game a little harder for yourself, but it's still 
winnable. They can be annoying and tedious, but have rewards. Sounds a 
lot like Sokoban to me.

I think Sokoban adds variation do the game, thus making it a better 
game, while allowing people who don't like it to skip it.

